-only config, environment, baseline, metric, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]artifact writers, and preserve only deliberate historical readers.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Synchronize CLI, schema, docs, and generated skill source[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]synchronize-contracts[dim] · [dim][/dim]after retire-legacy[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]synchronize-contracts: describe unconditional finalization across [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]configuration, workflows, CLI and xprompt docs, remove beta and legacy [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]guidance, update the canonical sase_final skill source and snapshots, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and preview generated runtime skills without deploying a dirty tree.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Run adversarial and live end-to-end acceptance[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]e2e-acceptance[dim] · [dim][/dim]after synchronize-contracts[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]e2e-acceptance: exercise the combined unconditional path through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]disposable repositories and real SASE launches, repair every in-scope [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]defect found, inspect finalizer artifacts and postconditions, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]produce the evidence required for landing and closing sase-ro.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-rr","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-rr.3","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-4167cc7f8c52fd7342bc8c2b0f1ba571","started_at":"2026-08-21T18:22:30.069805+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"c6506f85ea766f2c7621048d495043d90fca517a8d62051d740ec7b0912043db","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-rr.land--mon/chat.md","size_bytes":3103},"commits":{"di